  (2501, '2025', 'Alpine', 'A290 GTS', '', 'Norev', 'Minijet Alpine Vision Blue & Black', 'France', 'Hot Hatch', 'Norev proudly presents a 1:64 scale miniature of the brand-new Alpine A290 in its top-tier GTS trim, featuring exclusive wheels and decorative details. This model offers a faithful and playful representation of the Alpine original, perfect for collectors and admirers alike.', 0),
