  (1325, '1972', 'Alpine', 'Renault A110 1600S RTL Monte Carlo', '', 'Norev', 'Multigam Classic', 'French', 'Classic Rally', 'The standard 1600 went out of production in 1971 and since then the 1600S has undergone a development involving both road and racing cars. For the 1973 vintage the 1605cc was adopted which developed 140 horsepower. The A110 1600S left an indelible mark in competition, with countless rally victories.', 0),
