  (2654, '2023', 'Cadillac', 'Project GTP Hypercar', '', 'Hot Wheels', '2024 HW Turbo', '', 'Endurance Legends', 'Behold the Cadillac� of the future. Sporting an all-new 5.5-literV-8 engine paired with an electric motor, this sleek and beautiful speeder is a stealth fighter disguised as a hyper car.', 0),
