  (91, '2003', 'Cadillac', 'V-16 Concept', '', 'Hot Wheels', '2007 Treasure Hunts', '', 'Modern Concepts', 'Built with bold lines and a 1000-horsepower V16 engine, this luxury concept car was made for living the high life on the open highway.', 0),
