  (253, '', 'Ferrari', 'Thomassima III', '', 'Hot Wheels', '2000 First Editions', '', 'Retro Concepts', 'This was the third in a series of three concept cars designed by Tom Meade, an American automotive designer and coachbuilder who resided in Italy for a time. The car used a Ferrari Colombo V12 and featured gullwing doors.', 0),
