  (1605, '1974', 'Gulf', 'Mirage', '', 'Tintoys', 'Unknown', 'UK', 'Endurance Legends', 'The GR7 model was renamed to Gulf GR7 for 1974, reflecting the sponsorship involvement of Gulf Oil which dated from 1967. "Gulf Ford" placed second in the 1974 World Championship for Makes.', 0),
