  (403, 'N/A', 'Hot Wheels', 'Fish''d & Chip''d', '', 'Hot Wheels', '2017 Multipack Exclusive', 'El Segundo', '', 'HW Designer Fraser Campbell wanted to do a Jaguar model for the Hot Wheels lineup. However, there was no license to do a replica of the existing Jaguar of choice. Graphics designer Wayne Scott mentioned customizing the Jag by chopping the roof line and lowering it.', 0),
  (2297, 'N/A', 'Hot Wheels', 'Fish''d & Chip''d', '', 'Hot Wheels', '2025 HW Designed By', 'El Segundo', '', 'HW Designer Fraser Campbell wanted to do a Jaguar model for the Hot Wheels lineup. However, there was no license to do a replica of the existing Jaguar of choice. Graphics designer Wayne Scott mentioned customizing the Jag by chopping the roof line and lowering it.', 0),
