  (179, 'N/A', 'Hot Wheels', 'La Fasta', '', 'Hot Wheels', '', 'El Segundo', 'Modern Super Cars', 'The La Fasta is a Hot Wheels casting designed by Fraser Campbell with design cues from the DeTomaso Pantera.', 0),
