  (1642, '1975', 'Lotus', 'Esprit S1', '', 'Hot Wheels', '', '', '', 'British supercar powered by the Lotus 970 4-cylinder engine. It''s probably most famous for the 1977 James Bond film The Spy Who Loved Me, where it was featured in a long chase sequence and was transformed into a submarine.', 0),
