  (2496, '2023', 'Renault', 'Espace Esprit Alpine E-Tech Hybrid', '', 'Norev', 'Minijet Pearl White', 'France', 'Sports Utility Heroes', 'When the time came to renew the Espace, Renault decided to offer an SUV-type silhouette with maximum space for 7 to 5 people. And it''s true that this vehicle, with its Esprit Alpine finish, is not lacking in appeal.', 0),
